    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the quiet and vast forest of Suverdale in the third person as Mati (or Matine), a 12-year-old kid visiting his grandparents on his summer vacation in this adventure game. Try to discover the mysteries behind Suverdale's history, but expect a surprise or two. Talk with its inhabitants to find the forest's secrets and decide whether you'll help them achieve their individual goals or not.</p>",
